===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|leuȝke}}, {{m|enm|leuk}}, {{m|enm|leuke}}, {{m|enm|lewk}}, {{m|enm|lewke}}, {{m|enm|louk}}, {{m|enm|luk}}, {{m|enm|luke}}, probably from {{inh|en|ang||*hlēoc}} beside {{m|ang||hlēow-}} (whence {{m|en|lew}}); compare {{m|ang|rēoc}} and {{m|ang|rēow}}, {{m|ang|slēac}} and {{m|ang|un-slēaw}}, etc.<ref>{{R:MED Online|leuk|adj|MED25306}}</ref>

